<p>Reports incorrect bean/method references in the <code>value</code> parameter of the @MockitoBean, @MockitoSpyBean and @TestBean annotations.

<p>Also reports an unnamed @MockitoBean / @MockitoSpyBean field whose type matches more than one bean and whose field name matches
none of them: the bean to override cannot be selected and the test fails at runtime. Specify the target bean name to resolve it.

<p><b>Example:</b></p>
<pre><code>
@SpringBootTest
class TestBeanApplicationTests {
   @TestBean(value = "unknownBean", methodName="createUserService")  // reports 1. "Cannot resolve 'unknownBean' bean"  and 2. "Cannot resolve symbol 'createUserService'"
   UserService userService;

  @TestBean  // reports "Cannot find static factory method"
  UserService userService;

  @MockitoBean  // reports "Could not resolve the bean to override. There is more than one bean of 'UserService' type"
  UserService userService;  // two beans of type UserService exist, and none is named "userService"
}
</code></pre>
